msgid "Could not decrypt {browser}'s cookies (DPAPI decryption failed). This usually means yt-dlp needs updating to support this browser's newer cookie encryption. Try 'Update yt-dlp now' below, then export again, or export from Firefox instead, which does not use this encryption. If it still fails, use the manual cookies.txt method."
